A Zodiac Loadout or Zodiac Build refers to how Zodiacs are assigned to Planets for specific tasks. There is a vast number of different Loadouts for various stages of the game.

== Early Attack Builds ==
{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Scorp|merc=Canc|venus=Pisc|moon=Scorp|mars=Canc|jupiter=Scorp|saturn=Canc|uranus=Canc|nept=Scorp|pluto=Pisc|chiron=Pisc|fortune=Pisc}}
Full water: will push attacks the fastest at the start

{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Aries|merc=Pisc|venus=Pisc|moon=Pisc|mars=Pisc|jupiter=Aqua|saturn=Pisc|uranus=Pisc|nept=Pisc|pluto=Pisc|chiron=Pisc|fortune=Pisc}}
Mostly Pisces: Higher quality zodiacs

{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Pisc|merc=Pisc|venus=Pisc|moon=Scorp|mars=Pisc|jupiter=Aqua|saturn=Canc|uranus=Pisc|nept=Scorp|pluto=Pisc|chiron=Pisc|fortune=Pisc}}
Water + wind: easier to get through unity, still great for attacks

== Late Attack Builds ==

=== Quality Build (ht6 done) ===
{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Pisc|merc=Pisc|venus=Pisc|moon=Pisc|mars=Pisc|jupiter=Pisc|saturn=Pisc|uranus=Pisc|nept=Pisc|pluto=Pisc|chiron=Pisc|fortune=Pisc}}
Full Pisces gives you a significant increase in Zodiac quality which overshadows the decrease in Zodiac level.

=== Game Speed Build (ht6 done) ===
{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Pisc|merc=Pisc|venus=Pisc|moon=Pisc|mars=Pisc|jupiter=Pisc|saturn=Pisc|uranus=Pisc|nept=Scorp|pluto=Pisc|chiron=Pisc|fortune=Pisc}}
Minimizes the amount of Zodiacs you would need to farm, while also maximizing all Game Speed buffs.

=== Score Build (500+) and IT2 build ===
{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Aqua|merc=Aqua|venus=Aqua|moon=Libra|mars=Libra|jupiter=Libra|saturn=Leo|uranus=Aries|nept=Leo|pluto=Aries|chiron=Aries|fortune=Aries}}

=== Gold Farm Build (ach 240 done) ===
{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Aqua|merc=Aqua|venus=Aqua|moon=Libra|mars=Scorp|jupiter=Scorp|saturn=Canc|uranus=Aries|nept=Canc|pluto=Aries|chiron=Aries|fortune=Aries}}
Gets close to maximizing score and planet buffs with a large increase to your GS allowing you to get very close to where you were before, but speeding up the grind by a lot.
Use all Gemini with the Unity Farm macro to reach up to 12 Unities per second, but this is obsolete.
=== Astrodust Farm Build ===
{{Zodiac Loadout|sun=Pisc|merc=Pisc|venus=Pisc|moon=Pisc|mars=Pisc|jupiter=Pisc|saturn=Pisc|uranus=Pisc|nept=Pisc|pluto=Aries|chiron=Pisc|fortune=Pisc}}
Maximizes [[Planet Shop|zodiac sale price]] with speed, side note the Aries can go anywhere as Pisces and Aries are the same season.

